  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41123" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Industrial Development Organization</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">China-Africa-UNIDO CoE Agriculture modernization Pillar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address the inter-linked challenges across industries, Ethiopia, China, and UNIDO agreed to jointly develop a Center of Excellence (CoE) to deliver innovative solutions. The overall purpose of CoE is to implement the Global Development Initiative and the Ethiopian Ten-Year Perspective Development Plan, and to facilitate Africa#s industrialization, agriculture modernization, and talent development, to contribute to the implementation of the United Nations 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development. The center will be built as an incubation platform for multilateral achievements, a demonstration platform for bilateral achievements, and an experimental platform for innovative cooperation methods, providing integrated services with a series of replicable and scalable projects through three pillars: Industrialization (Digitalization and Energy), agriculture modernization, talent development. For the sector intervention of Agriculture modernization, the Pillar aims to enhance the agro-processing capacity, upgrade targeted value chains, and facilitate access to technologies required for smallholder farmers and agribusinesses, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regular Programme Of Technical Cooperati</narrative>
  </participating-org>
